  "_comment": "Story segment definitions for tools/kaizo_pass.py bulk. Each segment's level_band [lo, hi] anchors its trainers ~5-8 levels below the upcoming gym leader's ace (Brock 22, Misty 35, Surge 48, Erika 62, Koga 78, Sabrina 90, Blaine 100, Giovanni 110, E4 118-125): trainers are rescaled from the segment's pre-pass baseline min/max onto the band, preserving relative strength. min_team pads teams up to that size from pad_pool (deduped within a team), item_pool supplies the held item for the last mon of padded teams. Maps not listed are never touched; bosses and rematch variants are always skipped. Rematch scaling (+2 route / +5 boss per win) stacks on top of these bands and clamps at MAX_LEVEL 255.",
